# This file exists to keep `flutter/assets/legal/` in version control so the
# `assets: - assets/legal/` declaration in pubspec.yaml resolves cleanly even
# before `scripts/sync-legal.sh` has been run. The actual content files
# (PRIVACY_POLICY.md, TERMS_OF_SERVICE.md) are gitignored and synced from
# the canonical copies under `/legal/` at build time.
